  - name: node_composite
    interval: 30s
    rules:
      - record: node:system_pressure:score
        expr: <STUDENT_IMPLEMENTS>
        # Must return: a weighted composite score (0â100) per instance
        # Weights: cpu_utilization 40%, memory_utilization*100 35%, disk_utilization*100 25%
        # All inputs must come from node_base recording rule metrics only

      - record: node:network_throughput:rate5m_mbps
        expr: <STUDENT_IMPLEMENTS>
        # Must return: node:network_throughput:rate5m_bytes converted to megabits per second
        # Input must come from node_base recording rule metrics only
Confirmation: Run curl -fsSL 'http://localhost:9090/api/v1/rules' | python3 -c "import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); [print(g['name'], len(g['rules']), 'rules') for g in d['data']['groups']]" and confirm both node_base and node_composite appear with the correct rule counts.

